,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b6hcC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80940d0e-9a80-4827-b981-673ef5bcb597","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/vim-quickrun-neovim-job|vim-quickrun-neovim-job\u003eを使う形でいけました！ありがとうございます！\n\nsniprunも少し調べてみます :thinking_face:","ts":"1635689396.360100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U78A6ESHM","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b/p7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"679a7d5d-c29a-4d1c-841d-34981ad9d124","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"なんか前に見たかも？\n\u003chttps://github.com/michaelb/sniprun\u003e\nこれとかどうなんでしょう？Neovim なんも知らないのでよくわからないですが。","ts":"1635689276.358500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"michaelb/sniprun","id":1,"title":"michaelb/sniprun","text":"A neovim plugin to run lines/blocs of code (independently of the rest of the file), supporting multiples languages","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"398","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Rust","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pZZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fc4f4e8-8c7d-46ae-8f76-48697d7e05cc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"terminalもAPI違うのでNeovimだと死にそう(忘れてた)","ts":"1635689155.357300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m7N1P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45b88e13-ae05-4023-8e3c-8f6d631040e4","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/vim-quickrun-neovim-job\u003e","ts":"1635689143.356900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"lambdalisue/vim-quickrun-neovim-job","id":1,"title":"lambdalisue/vim-quickrun-neovim-job","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"15","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q+W/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ba54d03-d2a5-4f57-95d1-3965b6410e88","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"あ、じゃあ、jobじゃなくてterminalのほうがいいかな","ts":"1635689138.356700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K/t6P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c3941c4-17ec-4787-8da0-7b4cfcdd11f1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"便利な絵文字だ","ts":"1635689137.356600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sVfEy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f14b6df-8aa7-48fa-b661-77ae5dc58308","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"neovim じゃ job 動かないので :lambdalisue: さんのを入れないとダメです","ts":"1635689115.356100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cQmzg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79a8042f-8bc6-4d7e-bed8-27ceeeeccdf8","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"あ、そんな簡単にできるんですか","ts":"1635689109.355900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/E1Fx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9932e473-f532-43b2-aca1-d826ab8b1a34","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"でよいかと","ts":"1635689098.355400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8B8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ca6c85d-5980-469e-9669-847bc1f76e57","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"vimprocを消す目的なら\n```\tlet g:quickrun_config = {\n\t\t\\ '_': { 'runner': 'job' }\n\t\t\\ }```","ts":"1635689092.355200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yk4D8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2775a256-64ed-4aad-bccf-07143b821c44","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"現在使ってるのは `ruby -e` をカレントバッファに対して実行する　くらいの用途です。\n\n動機は、vimprocが現状deinとquickrunで使われているのですが、dein =\u0026gt; packerに置き換えたので、quickrunも上位互換のようなものがあればvimprocも消せるなーと整理していただけな些細な理由でした\njob runnerは全然知識がないので調べてみます！","ts":"1635689059.354700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qun/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5778f823-38ed-4a82-aa0d-54b7da31153a","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"quickrunの機能をどのくらい使われているかで回答が変わる気がします","ts":"1635688825.351600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4dVK6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2daf86ee-9b41-4975-bf39-57563171e0e4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"quickrunを遅いと感じたことがないので、何に入れ替えても速度はそこまで変わらない気がする","ts":"1635688811.351300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vNpc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7e1ed82-704e-4e86-935c-63fbe56004ba","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"job runnerに切り替えるだけでもいいような気がするけど、どうなんだろう","ts":"1635688784.350400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fTjf7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a935bdcc-9afb-4ca4-8e2c-28afa5e6f7fe","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"vimproc \u0026amp; quickrunを現在使用していて、lua製などのnvimの高速なpluginの置き換えできるものないかなーと探しているのですが、ご存知の方いらっしゃいますでしょうか","ts":"1635688643.350000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wcr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7E8C4DF9-3F34-43F2-917B-DA9442BA084B","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"polyglot自体がfiletype plugin managerと考えれば納得できるかもしれない。\nプラグインマネージャー使う人はpolyglot入れずに各filetype plugin入れなさい的な。\ndeinならマージもできるし。(polyglotのウリの一つはマージされてるから起動が速いこと)","ts":"1635679048.348100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7zJkQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bd31004-0757-477b-9bd9-d1970689fcea","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"rtp弄るのはプラグインマネージャーだけにして欲しい","ts":"1635676433.343500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bGI4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8acefd8-dad9-439d-bb69-af86c56a3c14","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"闇が深すぎる","ts":"1635676416.342900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3YR2B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2B390166-C9F9-400B-A43A-5886831AF4B2","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"我慢するか使うのやめるのが正解だと思いました。\n(直したやつ使ってるわけですが","ts":"1635676069.342600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RSPmi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59532D95-B809-4541-B48E-EBF77E4CF900","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"rtpを勝手に後からいじるので色々壊れます。\nPR送ってるけど1ヶ月前から更新がない。","ts":"1635675983.341500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fearful","count":1,"users":["U7JL1UKKL"]},{"name":"tsurai_orange","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LEwW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bffe3054-65c2-45b9-a97c-2d772df67ac7","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ユーザー由来の設定を上書きするようになってるのかもしれない","ts":"1635672970.340200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"okGy2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"012d6df1-8089-47d9-b3dd-31c3a745624c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Polygotの挙動怪しいな","ts":"1635672957.339700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fdo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe260745-be47-4bc5-aa5c-8ab48bccc2b7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ああ、そういう挙動が見えたのか...でもそれも謎ですね","ts":"1635667617.339300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZSpq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9419f1f4-6ee1-40c0-bc65-e7de1d43f7dc","type":"message","user":"U02K82RGT2B","text":"そうか、vim のというより、polyglot の挙動なのか、","ts":"1635667566.338900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9c+1g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b4e7880-1101-412c-ae4f-d5dbbc4c6c7c","type":"message","user":"U02K82RGT2B","text":"```autocmd BufNewFile,BufRead *.s setlocal filetype=nasm```\nでは filetype は更新されないが、\n```autocmd BufNewFile,BufRead *.s setlocal filetype=nasm\nautocmd BufNewFile,BufRead *.s put ='hoge'```\nとすると更新するようになるので、バッファのflush的なものが必要なんでしょうか、","ts":"1635667536.338200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YJP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae48272c-7aa8-4e9f-8d74-83ee586cbb83","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"polyglotがいろいろを纏めて処理するためにちょっとトリッキーな部分があるから難しいな....なんでなんだろ","ts":"1635667511.337800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GKOh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a9a256c-bcc4-4124-8cba-c5e831012331","type":"message","user":"U02K82RGT2B","text":"とりあえず polyglot の使用をやめて問題は解決したのですが、vim の挙動をもっとちゃんと把握したいと思い、、","ts":"1635667387.336000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eCSaG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0aba66a7-41bf-4dc1-a778-dc4f99a2165a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"nasm使わないなら `g:polyglot_is_disabled` でoffれる...かな?\nなんか項目なさそうだから、polyglotのftdetect機能自体を止める `ftdetect` を設定する必要があるかも?","ts":"1635667330.335800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fogc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c48cf87-fc78-4a16-a0f1-48e7ad4f11a3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ううん...","ts":"1635667070.334100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nRkQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"942c5176-4986-45e3-bd18-48e9a7bdc950","type":"message","user":"U02K82RGT2B","text":"set runtimepath すると polyglot/after の後に .vim/after があるのでこちらが優先されるのかなと思ったのですが、そんなことはないんでしょうか","ts":"1635667060.333900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cpoH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a7f880f-6f41-42a0-8097-bb1aad269890","type":"message","user":"U02K82RGT2B","text":"verboseすると polyglot の設定が有効になっていると表示されます","ts":"1635666918.332800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2RtD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4fa8679-3a28-432c-8f36-0bc482adaf7d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"polyglotの中でafter/ftdetectな処理があるから、ユーザーのさらに後で動いてるとか?\nまたverboseしてみてどうなのか見れますか?","ts":"1635666856.332100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"raDy6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b27b5e7-0591-4871-8580-ee780f2599a0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれえ?","ts":"1635666808.331400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9rRT3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b733389-ba48-4d62-b856-c469acf3d989","type":"message","user":"U02K82RGT2B","text":"~/.vim/after/ftdetect/asm.vim を作成し、\n```autocmd BufNewFile,BufRead *.s setlocal filetype=nasm```\nの記述を追加したのですが設定が上書きされず、、\n\nこのファイルが読み込まれていないのかと思い、試しに\n```autocmd BufNewFile,BufRead *.s put ='hoge'```\nのような記述にしてみると、これはちゃんと実行されていました。\n\nそしてなぜか↑の2つを同時に記述すると、filetype の設定が nasm に上書きされます。","ts":"1635666787.331100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JP1A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"558bdf75-67ab-469f-9920-015eefa0c061","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ファイルにUUID拡張子を付けよう","ts":"1635666772.330900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bSE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ed4c75b-4d18-4bfa-9f0f-a55656d153e3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"~hoge.02a59147-7ead-4708-9c38-e22644ceb26c~","ts":"1635666620.328600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hLq="}]},{"client_msg_id":"4668bd1a-e813-442c-af59-c6da535df854","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"~そもそも拡張子が競合するのは拡張子のネームスペースが狭すぎるのが原因の1つでもあるのでUUIDにしてしまうのがいいのでは~","ts":"1635666589.328100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TCsL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c085a35-c75f-4bc3-b7a9-fb761caa7773","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"polyglotはwhitelistだとよさそうな気がしてるけど","ts":"1635666344.324800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DTXS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EEA2AC88-DFF6-44A5-BB7A-0FB0C25BF13D","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私も昔はpolyglot入れてましたが今は外しましたねー。無効にしてからしばらくの間、たまにしか開かない拡張子のファイルを開いては\n「polyglot、お前だったのか。いつもシンタックスハイライトを付けてくれたのは」ってなってた","ts":"1635666314.324300","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1635666499.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fox_face","count":2,"users":["U02BDFBM620","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wrv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d160e75c-1eae-4d63-9ed3-626c77caf943","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"treesitterはtreesitter自体が定期的に壊れるけど余計なことはあんまりしない気がしてる","ts":"1635666314.324200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w+rW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59c8d323-87ed-4f3f-912e-a3fc45d2b75a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あー、読めてなかったw 確かにそれはありそう","ts":"1635666311.323900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s4mJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e46f5a15-cd3d-4127-a79d-45d71450ad10","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、treesitterを入れてpolyglotを外したって意味でした","ts":"1635666284.322600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eH="}]},{"client_msg_id":"104f0e2b-dfce-4389-865b-5131747d0da5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"シンタックスハイライト教信者なのでtreesitterは入れたままだな、トラブルにはもう慣れてしまった","ts":"1635666199.320500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OjD3P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36598ae5-037c-442b-8cb0-3dc3659e4d28","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Neovimだとtreesitterで外したって人が多いですよね","ts":"1635666152.319100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ldo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"122312e8-eb97-4784-8b65-75078c6e2b4b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"面倒な割にそんな利がないと思ってるので私は入れてない","ts":"1635666131.318800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8P/Xb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b873f474-f556-472b-ba0f-5b32ad46faef","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"polyglot、やっぱり定期的にこの辺で話題になりますねぇ","ts":"1635666101.318300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W5v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1327ac2-de96-4a63-b408-7e3c7a0c9324","type":"message","user":"U02K82RGT2B","text":"ありがとうございます！\n\n\u0026gt; .sファイルひらいてから:99verbose set filetype\n\u0026gt; でだれがfiletype=rセットしてるかがわかるのでそれでわかりそうです\nこれめちゃくちゃ便利ですね。実行してみた結果、`vim-polyglot` が設定していました。\n\nafter ftdetect で設定する文化がなかったのですが、こちらの方が確実そうなのでこれからはこの方法で設定しようと思います。","ts":"1635664819.317800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q5Irv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46838e9b-a095-4d6b-bc14-e2e48d2bab12","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、Shougoさんのいうように、after ftdetectな設定することで強制上書きがアンパイかなあ","ts":"1635662801.315700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qPk8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3768d6d8-3454-4772-a40f-94d3426eec6b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶんファイルタイププラグインがあるので、そのプラグインで設定可能ならsを除外するかな","ts":"1635662732.315200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eDMj6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d6610e0-dd8a-487d-bacc-cd65893a6935","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"after ftdetectとかに書いた方がよいと思います","ts":"1635662731.315100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KHD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a0a39af-16b1-4aee-b2d0-2af641ab3e00","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":".sファイルひらいてから:99verbose set filetype\nでだれがfiletype=rセットしてるかがわかるのでそれでわかりそうです","ts":"1635662709.314000","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1635662730.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vnx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7498b1da-2b07-4388-8bd7-7d2dc1dbf6ee","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"多分、autocmd の実行後に、filetype=r が設定されてるからだと思います","ts":"1635662688.313400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pCfD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42c76633-5280-4057-b9b5-a3fcc6842b5a","type":"message","user":"U02K82RGT2B","text":"はじめまして。vimでfiletypeの設定に困っており、小一時間格闘しても解決せず、こちらで質問させてください :pray:\n\n`.s` ファイルを `filetype=nasm` として開きたく、vimrc に\n```autocmd BufNewFile,BufRead *.s set filetype=nasm```\nの記述を足したのですが、適当な `.s` ファイルをいくつか開いてみても `filetype=r` と設定されています。\n`nasm` の部分を `asm` 等に変えても結果は変わりませんでした。\nファイルを開いた上で、 `set filetype=nasm` とすると、適切に設定され、シンタックスハイライトも読み込まれます。\nまた、 `*.s` の部分を `*.asm` に変え、該当するファイルを読み込むと、 `filetype=nasm` が設定されます。\nなぜ `*.s` の場合だけうまくいかないのでしょうか。","ts":"1635662619.312600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yUD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab51fd07-152c-43e4-9c0d-88aac5a2b601","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"デーモンが嫌でgit-prompt.zshに移行してしまった、それ以外はとても気に入っていた","ts":"1635654754.305900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AyV/a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f240a03-d0d5-4463-a126-9e10b875a640","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"p10k、git 情報の表示が早いんですよね(他のステータスラインはちょっと表示までのラグがあったり)。\nまぁ、勝手に gitstatusd というデーモンをダウンロードして走らせるので、好みが出ますが。","ts":"1635654694.305300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VVwH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66BA9B3E-F2A1-4552-9E12-6805C2420D68","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"p10k導入がすごく親切で入れた時びっくりしました","ts":"1635654348.301700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IkhmY"}]}]
